  "summary": "The APU has shut down, either by itself after a failure (AUTO) or by the APU FIRE pb, the APU SHUT OFF sw or a detected fire on ground (EMER). The only ECAM line is MASTER SW OFF. After an automatic shutdown a restart can be considered, within the limit on start attempts.",
